	// It builds a generalized suffix tree, then for each internal node with string depth >= threshold,
	// the leaves in its subtree are all clones
	// The maximal groups correspond to the deepest internal nodes

	// Let me implement this properly using the LCP array approach to simulate suffix tree traversal

