# 1. Group clones by filename
# 2. For each filename group, sort by StartTok
# 3. Use a linear scan to remove overlapping clones (keep earliest start)

# Also, for large SA ranges (1000+ positions), we can SHORT-CIRCUIT:
# If a node has too many SA positions, it will likely produce too many clones
# that will all be filtered anyway. We can skip such nodes.
# 
# The original dupl likely does this - for large SA ranges, the clones are
